{"seq":2,"slug":"web-vitals-library","title":"web-vitals 库与归因采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/collection/web-vitals-library","wordCount":626,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"web-vitals-库与归因采集\">web-vitals 库与归因采集</h1><p>Google Chrome 团队维护的 <code>web-vitals</code> 库（npm 包 ~1.5KB gzipped）是采集 Core Web Vitals 的事实标准。它在 PerformanceObserver 之上封装了所有指标的计算逻辑——会话窗口算法、交互分组、最终值锁定——让开发者只需三行代码就能获得生产级精度的指标数据。其 attribution build 更进一步，为每个指标附加根因归因信息，直接支撑调试工作流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>web-vitals 库解决了一个看似简单但实际复杂的问题：如何正确计算 Core Web Vitals 的最终值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[PerformanceObserver&lt;br/&gt;原始条目流] --&gt; B[web-vitals 库]&#10;    B --&gt; C[指标计算逻辑&lt;br/&gt;会话窗口/交互分组]&#10;    B --&gt; D[最终值锁定&lt;br/&gt;visibilitychange/pagehide]&#10;    B --&gt; E[归因数据&lt;br/&gt;attribution build]&#10;    C --&gt; F[onLCP / onINP / onCLS&lt;br/&gt;标准化回调]&#10;    E --&gt; G[元素/脚本/子阶段&lt;br/&gt;根因定位]\">graph LR\n    A[PerformanceObserver&lt;br/&gt;原始条目流] --&gt; B[web-vitals 库]\n    B --&gt; C[指标计算逻辑&lt;br/&gt;会话窗口/交互分组]\n    B --&gt; D[最终值锁定&lt;br/&gt;visibilitychange/pagehide]\n    B --&gt; E[归因数据&lt;br/&gt;attribution build]\n    C --&gt; F[onLCP / onINP / onCLS&lt;br/&gt;标准化回调]\n    E --&gt; G[元素/脚本/子阶段&lt;br/&gt;根因定位]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>标准 build</th>\n<th>Attribution build</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包大小</td>\n<td>~1.5KB gzipped</td>\n<td>~3KB gzipped</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导入路径</td>\n<td><code>web-vitals</code></td>\n<td><code>web-vitals/attribution</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标值</td>\n<td>LCP/INP/CLS 数值</td>\n<td>同左 + 归因详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>生产全量采集</td>\n<td>采样 + 调试分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能开销</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>略高（需保留更多上下文）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基础集成\">基础集成</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } from &#39;web-vitals&#39;;&#10;&#10;function sendToAnalytics(metric: {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  value: number;&#10;  id: string;&#10;  delta: number;&#10;  rating: &#39;good&#39; | &#39;needs-improvement&#39; | &#39;poor&#39;;&#10;}) {&#10;  const body = JSON.stringify({&#10;    name: metric.name,&#10;    value: metric.value,&#10;    rating: metric.rating,&#10;    page: window.location.pathname,&#10;    connection: (navigator as any).connection?.effectiveType,&#10;    timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  // 优先使用 sendBeacon 确保数据不因页面卸载丢失&#10;  if (navigator.sendBeacon) {&#10;    navigator.sendBeacon(&#39;/api/vitals&#39;, body);&#10;  } else {&#10;    fetch(&#39;/api/vitals&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body, keepalive: true });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;onLCP(sendToAnalytics);&#10;onINP(sendToAnalytics);&#10;onCLS(sendToAnalytics);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sendToAnalytics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  delta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'good'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'needs-improvement'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'poor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: metric.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    value: metric.value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rating: metric.rating,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    page: window.location.pathname,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    connection: (navigator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).connection?.effectiveType,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timestamp: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 优先使用 sendBeacon 确保数据不因页面卸载丢失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (navigator.sendBeacon) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    navigator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendBeacon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/vitals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body, keepalive: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onLCP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendToAnalytics);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onINP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendToAnalytics);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onCLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendToAnalytics);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个回调函数只在指标的&quot;最终值&quot;确定后触发一次（LCP 在 visibilitychange 时锁定；INP 在页面卸载时确定；CLS 持续更新直到最大会话窗口稳定）。<code>delta</code> 字段表示自上次报告以来的增量——对 CLS 尤为重要，因为它可能多次回调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"attribution-build-深度归因\">Attribution Build 深度归因</h2><p>Attribution build 在每次回调中提供 <code>attribution</code> 对象，包含指标恶化的具体根因：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } from &#39;web-vitals/attribution&#39;;&#10;&#10;// LCP 归因：拆解 4 个子阶段&#10;onLCP((metric) =&gt; {&#10;  const { attribution } = metric;&#10;  console.log({&#10;    element: attribution.element, // LCP 元素选择器&#10;    url: attribution.url, // 资源 URL&#10;    timeToFirstByte: attribution.timeToFirstByte,&#10;    resourceLoadDelay: attribution.resourceLoadDelay,&#10;    resourceLoadDuration: attribution.resourceLoadDuration,&#10;    elementRenderDelay: attribution.elementRenderDelay,&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;// INP 归因：定位慢交互的元素和脚本&#10;onINP((metric) =&gt; {&#10;  const { attribution } = metric;&#10;  console.log({&#10;    interactionTarget: attribution.interactionTarget, // 交互元素&#10;    interactionType: attribution.interactionType, // click/keydown/pointerdown&#10;    inputDelay: attribution.inputDelay,&#10;    processingDuration: attribution.processingDuration,&#10;    presentationDelay: attribution.presentationDelay,&#10;    // LoAF 脚本级归因（Chrome 123+）&#10;    longAnimationFrameEntries: attribution.longAnimationFrameEntries,&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;// CLS 归因：定位最大偏移的来源元素&#10;onCLS((metric) =&gt; {&#10;  const { attribution } = metric;&#10;  console.log({&#10;    largestShiftTarget: attribution.largestShiftTarget,&#10;    largestShiftValue: attribution.largestShiftValue,&#10;    largestShiftTime: attribution.largestShiftTime,&#10;    loadState: attribution.loadState, // &#39;loading&#39; | &#39;dom-interactive&#39; | &#39;complete&#39;&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { onLCP, onINP, onCLS } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'web-vitals/attribution'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LCP 归因：拆解 4 个子阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onLCP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metric;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element: attribution.element, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LCP 元素选择器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    url: attribution.url, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 资源 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timeToFirstByte: attribution.timeToFirstByte,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resourceLoadDelay: attribution.resourceLoadDelay,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resourceLoadDuration: attribution.resourceLoadDuration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    elementRenderDelay: attribution.elementRenderDelay,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}